/E (Suggested Improvement :)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
432 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 97 0 R
/E ( Using a more complex architecture \(e.g., more layers or neurons\) could help the model learn richer patterns and potentially improve performance.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
