>>
endobj
436 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 98 0 R
/E (This project allowed us to build a model that is closely aligned with our problem and personal interest, combining data mining techniques with a real-life concern: smartphone addiction. It was a valuable experience to move from theoretical concepts to practical application, where we could see how models are actually built, trained, and interpreted. Working on real data and extracting meaningful insights made the learning process much more engaging and impactful.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
437 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 98 0 R
/E (Overall, this project helped us better understand both the technical and human aspects of data science, showing how analytical tools can be used to address real-world issues.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
438 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 98 0 R
/E (This experience was not only about building a model, but also about developing a deeper understanding of how data can be used to create value and insights.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
